  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a164733dd5d9d0b",
      "translationZh": "昨天 TechCrunch 发表了一篇文章，讨论了 AI 智能体面临的一个日益严重的问题：网站开始屏蔽它们。亚马逊屏蔽 Meta 的 Muse 就是一个显而易见的例子。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2329ceda776c39c2",
      "translationZh": "几乎在同一时间，在 4GB 内存的 Galaxy A04e 上本地运行的 GLM-Edge-1.5B-Chat 完成了一个真实的亚马逊购物车任务。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "add4ceed93b17462",
      "translationZh": "这延续了之前在本 subreddit 发布的小模型/浏览器实验。早期的测试包括在 2017 年的 Galaxy Note 8 上本地运行的 Qwen3-0.6B，随后是在 Galaxy S21 上通过真实浏览器会话运行的 Ministral 3 3B。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c4d48a4d78ccc2dd",
      "translationZh": "这些实验是 E2LLM/SiFR 持续开发的一部分，该项目是一个结构化的浏览器感知层。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a43f68ac17877ec",
      "translationZh": "模型：GLM-Edge-1.5B-Chat",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cfd862bbadf79433",
      "translationZh": "量化：Q4_K_M GGUF",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "05e8c3f688ade851",
      "translationZh": "来源：官方 Z ai Hugging Face 发布",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ba96bfd2859b5ace",
      "translationZh": "特定任务训练：无",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ec249963568f3ad0",
      "translationZh": "手机：Samsung Galaxy A04e, SM-A042F/DS, 4GB RAM",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "005411e2c48a0eb8",
      "translationZh": "发布的模型按原样使用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f182201689461a1",
      "translationZh": "浏览器是在 Amazon 上运行的普通桌面版 Firefox 会话。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a8b0aff4c19ece66",
      "translationZh": "寻找一包 24 节装的 AA 碱性电池",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "030e10bea7bfe2e1",
      "translationZh": "寻找黄色橡皮鸭",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64723d3236302259",
      "translationZh": "购物车 0，电池，购物车 1，橡皮鸭，购物车 2",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5192c0b618bb868",
      "translationZh": "相同的设置在 A04e 上运行了两次。两次运行均成功完成。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f65d3bf1f787553b",
      "translationZh": "在 A04e 上的完整运行时间：约 8.5 分钟。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "143a85d0caaffb4f",
      "translationZh": "在 Galaxy S21 上执行相同的流程：大约需要 3 分钟。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "379edcfca1c8e8da",
      "translationZh": "有趣的部分在于其架构。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4c5d6184036b578e",
      "translationZh": "该模型并不是作为一个代理以独立的浏览器服务形式到达 Amazon。它在本地运行，并通过现有的用户浏览器会话进行感知和操作。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6ed6115aba748a8f",
      "translationZh": "它也不接收截图或原始 HTML。它获取一个紧凑的结构化浏览器感知层，并在每一步做出所需的微小决策。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "04daf999ae99c31e",
      "translationZh": "这改变了访问问题，从：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "faf921f311595cfd",
      "translationZh": "“网站如何识别并准许一个 AI 代理进入？”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ebb20aef9faff1df",
      "translationZh": "“在现有的用户浏览器会话中允许进行什么操作？”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "25958904eeacc4b0",
      "translationZh": "更广泛的概念是浏览器即共享空间（Browser-as-Shared-Space，简称 BaSS）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bac99f1f75a14a32",
      "translationZh": "浏览器仍然是用户的空间，模型是与用户协作工作，而不是用一个独立的自主浏览器代理来取代用户。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "62cf09a3dade9c64",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Mean-Standard7390 提交",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    }
  ],
